}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List TACOTS Onboarding Records
  
  Returns a paginated list of TACOTS beneficiary onboarding records. Results are ordered by creation date and can be paginated via `page` and `limit` query parameters.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                       |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|-----------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (integer ≥ 1)         |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100)   |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of TACOTS onboarding records.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 25,
      "total": 42
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.            |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `read` permission.               |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
